# Publish a docs site > The maintainer's half
# ipm-overview:docs/use-cases/publish-site.md#L20
# ef1b92d59b7512ac69f84f6910bebca21635b2ee

# The whole publish, and the steps of its first half.
whole::a Publish a docs site ::e

embed::a Embed the diagrams ::e
  --> build::a Build the HTML ::e
  --> push::a Push to the site repository ::e
embed, build, push --::P--> whole

md-embed --> embed
md-html --> build

md::a Markdown pages --> embed, build
svg::a committed SVGs --> embed, build
conf::a md-html.conf.json --> build
html::a built HTML files --> build, push
repo::a infinite-pm-web --> push
dev::a Docs maintainer --> embed, build, push

md-embed --> embedder ::c, command-line tool ::c
md-html --> site generator ::c, command-line tool ::c
md --> Markdown page ::c
svg --> ipm SVG ::c
html --> static HTML ::c, output ::c
repo --> site source ::c
dev --> Maintainer ::c
